LTESniffer macOS ARM64 port kit
===============================

This kit contains patch series and build scripts that port LTESniffer and its
srsRAN radio stack to macOS on Apple Silicon (ARM64). It does not redistribute
upstream source; scripts/install.sh clones the pinned upstream commits and
applies the patches.

Upstream projects and their authors:

- LTESniffer
  SysSec, Korea Advanced Institute of Science and Technology (KAIST).
  https://github.com/SysSec-KAIST/LTESniffer
  Pinned commit: a694803082017ac2b349e6b113940e8b9ba2fe5b
  Licence: GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0).

- srsRAN2 (the srsRAN 21.10 fork that LTESniffer builds its radio stack from)
  https://github.com/ShaoPaoLao/srsRAN2
  Pinned commit: 0acc79d3fe5b153a18b62e8ef5af1a0fb2327a18
  Licence: GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0).

- srsRAN
  Software Radio Systems. https://www.srsran.com

The patches in this kit modify AGPL-3.0 licensed code. They are therefore
distributed under the same licence, AGPL-3.0. See the LICENSE file for the full
text. The patch authorship is recorded in the From lines of the patch files.

The standard srsRAN test identifiers used in the loopback validation
(IMSI 001010000000001, PLMN 001/01) are public test values from srsRAN.
